  en: {
    title: 'Terms and conditions of sale — CarSitting',
    description: 'General terms and conditions of sale of CarSitting: regular and one-off services, pricing, liability, insurance, personal data and mediation.',
    label: 'Contractual terms',
    h1: 'Terms and conditions of sale',
    effective: 'Effective as of 1 January 2024',
    toc: 'Contents',
    note: 'This English version is provided for convenience. In case of discrepancy, the French version prevails.',
    sections: [
      {
        num: 'I',
        title: 'Preamble',
        blocks: [
          { type: 'p', html: 'CARSITTING (hereinafter referred to as “CARSITTING SAS” or “the Service Provider”) is a French simplified joint-stock company (SAS) with a share capital of €3,000, registered with the Paris Trade and Companies Register under number 812 982 619, whose registered office is located at 14 rue Charles V, 75004 PARIS, France, with individual VAT identification number FR45812982619 and NAF code 9609Z. CARSITTING SAS is an automotive concierge company that primarily offers valet, jockey, chauffeur, vehicle transfer, and vehicle maintenance and cleaning services. These General Terms and Conditions of Sale (“GTCS”) apply to all services offered and performed by CARSITTING SAS.' },
          { type: 'p', html: 'Hereinafter referred to as:' },
          {
            type: 'ul',
            items: [
              '“Professional Beneficiary”: Any natural or legal person having requested one or more services from the Service Provider and acting for purposes within the scope of their commercial, industrial, craft, liberal or agricultural activity, including when acting in the name or on behalf of another professional.',
